  "_face_note": "ONE account, TWO wire faces. aigc.sankuai.com serves the same models over an OpenAI-compatible face (base_url, default) and an Anthropic-native face (faces.anthropic), sharing one set of API keys. Claude-family entries are routed to the anthropic face AUTOMATICALLY by lib/llm_dispatch/provider_face.resolve_face — they carry no per-model 'face' key, so a future opus-6/fable-6 is correct the day it is added. That face is the only one that emits thinking-block signature_delta (measured 2026-07-28: the OpenAI face streamed 111 chunks / 33 reasoning_content / 0 signature), and a thinking block replayed without its signature is rejected upstream. Do NOT delete faces.anthropic: a Claude entry with no anthropic face on this gateway is REFUSED at slot-build time rather than silently downgraded.",
